  "Text": "In July 2024 TxDOT awarded a $581 million contract to demolish and rebuild the interchange at I-635, and also rebuild the freeway eastward to Belt Line Road. Previously in June 2022, TxDOT awarded a $129 million contract to rebuild US 80 west of Forney between Lawson Road and Clements Drive. Long term plans include rebuilding and widening the freeway from Lawson Road to Interstate 30 in Dallas.",
